{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "6e94c7dd2a1c0500933e94394c5d31e477b3487d3f54b7a8b4afb4218a7cc27f", "ja": "ここが、あたしの地元だよぉ", "zh": "这里就是我的老家喔", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "811fb3f39fc29b3a2ac3b3b7f19cc9f8d758c16a755f2e8c9863d73658559456", "ja": "ひなたの地元、北海道にやってきた一行。\nひなたの実家に泊まる事になった可奈と紬は\nひなたの弟と一緒に、りんご磨きの手伝い\nなどをして過ごす。そうして、地元では少し\nお姉さんなひなたの一面に触れるのだった。", "zh": "一行来到了日向的家乡北海道。\n可奈和紬决定住在日向的老家，\n和日向的弟弟一起帮忙擦苹果，\n就这样度过了时光。她们也因此接触到了\n在家乡显得有些像姐姐一面的日向。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6db2a6cf263170cae33d690728b6bd4020e9a8da52e7fac95dad1ca0cc006f8f", "ja": "（これまで紬、可奈の地元を訪れた。\n最後はひなたの地元・北海道に、みんなで上陸だ！）", "zh": "（到目前为止，已经去过紬和可奈的故乡了。最后，大家一起登陆日向的故乡——北海道！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1001_036kan", "source_sha256": "4f8488dff9ec10bacd18fbe98d13c0ca804911a7596f3f96e4aa29aaf36ef5b2", "ja": "いよいよきたぞ～、北海道～♪\n飛行機から見たけど、本当にでっかいどう～♪", "zh": "终于到啦～，北海道～♪\n在飞机上看的时候，真的好大呀～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1002_035hin", "source_sha256": "c3d2ca65cc23379c29fb45ef52254a4f8632bedcc4f93506bd1739b0678bf89e", "ja": "みんな、こんな遠くまで来てもらって悪いねぇ。", "zh": "让大家跑这么远来，真是对不住呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1003_051tmg", "source_sha256": "86b63d15c83fb4010807305f4b988d08fcee8ce1eed5d6d62f4aef4342f7e3cc", "ja": "飛行機ですから、速いものです。\n時間だけなら、金沢のほうがかかったくらいですし。", "zh": "坐飞机嘛，很快的。要说花费的时间，反倒是去金泽更久一些。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1004_051tmg", "source_sha256": "302c5ccf8c0b147d1e051a970bcee0c8cdb86a590d41e66d6b098ff81507a19d", "ja": "それに、今回はあくまで勝負。対戦相手の\n手の内を探るのも、大切なことです。", "zh": "而且，这次毕竟是比赛。摸清对手的底细，也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1005_036kan", "source_sha256": "cd9250869b61546227ce0701ff0544fe8e6b35be2d431907cb2680e5e05564f2", "ja": "私もひなたちゃんのこと、もっと知りたい！\n……その、プレゼンの上手なまとめ方とかも！", "zh": "我也想更了解小雏！……那个，比如怎么把演讲内容整理得那么好之类的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1006_035hin", "source_sha256": "0235c2ed61b7d892762b7f5e2373b7b696d7b8e5f5414d47f9ab3310ff8d8f74", "ja": "ありゃ、そうだったねぇ。\nあたしのことだけ秘密じゃ、フェアじゃないべさ。", "zh": "哎呀，也是呢。\n就瞒着我自己的事，那也太不公平啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1007_p", "source_sha256": "8e85edd4d78d6a50c093736e51180fd4ddf54800240f2ff314d1e6958b6a54ed", "ja": "みんな、意欲的で嬉しい限りだな！\nそれでこの後は……。", "zh": "大家这么有干劲，真是太让人高兴了！\n那么接下来……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1008_035hin", "source_sha256": "9e69f3016f4efc05c107fbd60b443b0b24e3b9d6ebb9e50812008bdb38f5017a", "ja": "今日は、迎えがきてくれるよぉ。\n時間は伝えてあるから……あっ、ばあちゃん！", "zh": "今天有人来接我哦。\n我已经告诉他们时间了……啊，奶奶！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1009_baatyan", "source_sha256": "c2cb0574612b2238c024aa089cb9d5e899ad84d3dda2e0addc7f5e2d861edb50", "ja": "おかえり、ひなっこ。\nまた背ぇ伸びたかい？", "zh": "欢迎回来，小日向。\n又长高啦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1010_035hin", "source_sha256": "280bff972885f7150ffb6193051a958936240f9b8ef63e9d4ce35d2a7d6eb72c", "ja": "えへへ……ちょっこしね。\nみんな、あたしのばあちゃんだよぉ。", "zh": "嘿嘿……稍微长了一点呢。大家，这位是我奶奶哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1011_035hin", "source_sha256": "0766651bcb3f2b23d05d50d607f235d9ea448284ee96aaeaca63d958c3a46fce", "ja": "ばあちゃん、紹介するね。\n765プロの可奈ちゃんと紬さんだよぉ。", "zh": "奶奶，我来介绍一下。765Pro的可奈和紬姐。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1012_036kan", "source_sha256": "cda04d2d3f6b18f52ad3f45c7ad25e145f542198c79ccd05ef4bc3a8606af657", "ja": "はじめまして、矢吹可奈です！\n今日はよろしくお願いします！", "zh": "初次见面，我是矢吹可奈！\n今天还请多多关照！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1013_051tmg", "source_sha256": "cabcbe8273dcd861678c3f26f4f20ac4d3e64976c8e01635b215ab48a39cd270", "ja": "白石紬と申します。木下さんには、\n大変お世話になっております。", "zh": "我叫白石紬。平日里承蒙木下小姐关照了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1014_baatyan", "source_sha256": "b2c2457f7c88615df84aa04de311a4402a3716e5e019ba384278bc32b571aba1", "ja": "ありゃあ、めんこい子たちだねぇ。\n今日は長旅お疲れさんです。", "zh": "哎呀，真是一群可爱的孩子啊。\n今天长途跋涉，辛苦你们了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1015_p", "source_sha256": "89eae0c8f41339d87bc9752f4e363379feffb239d56a3962c5cb9b9d761f9b52", "ja": "765プロの{$P$}です。\nすみません、今回はお世話になります。", "zh": "我是765艺能的{$P$}。\n不好意思，这次要承蒙您关照了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1016_baatyan", "source_sha256": "d24fed2a4398cfc2cce3e797ce4c53608ba6a7f88d3b41830c9777c4bbcbf406", "ja": "なんもなんも。{$P$}さんのことは、\nよおく聞いてますから。", "zh": "没事没事。我可是早就听说过{$P$}先生了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1017_baatyan", "source_sha256": "9e80ec632cfba510cd19159afbd783433b8839b4379026183ba10483c1824992", "ja": "ひなっこと電話する度、\n{$P$}さんの話を……。", "zh": "每次和小雏打电话，都会聊到{$P$}先生……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1018_035hin", "source_sha256": "5af1058cd452ab9afa80ac8ea967eb5322891639a0d3041bf8a6ce3aed285bd5", "ja": "ば、ばあちゃん！\n話はほら、あとでもできるっしょや！？", "zh": "外、外婆！\n那、那个，聊天什么的，之后再说也行嘛！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1019_035hin", "source_sha256": "b87fff809a9f37ba1c2dbab135a2a832c4ee346111d82bfd0f077ea03e38221f", "ja": "それじゃ、出発だよぉ！", "zh": "那就出发咯！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1020_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1021_035hin", "source_sha256": "74b018a24181ecb4cd2481d84a994e94023a62e5c3144e20ec46613fb62ce428", "ja": "みんな、疲れたっしょや。今夜はたっぷりおもてなし\nするから、それまでゆっくりしててねぇ。", "zh": "大家累坏了吧。今晚我们会好好招待\n大家的，在那之前先好好歇着吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1022_p", "source_sha256": "963430bc179a1b59919d566cae91046d40804268a4cebc7d0d06ff7e6e585ade", "ja": "宿泊までさせてもらって、申し訳ないな。\nちゃんとホテルを取るつもりだったんだけど……。", "zh": "还让你们留宿，真是太不好意思了。\n本来是打算好好订个酒店的……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1023_baatyan", "source_sha256": "cf0f0f270c1e60dcad485e5119155999fed41405c1a9a6c41ce9bbc2edc3488d", "ja": "ひなっこがお世話になってるんだし、\nこれくらいは当然なんだわ。", "zh": "既然小雏一直受你照顾，这点小事当然是应该的啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1024_035hin", "source_sha256": "08e80d0d37428e1f79cab9f4b2241f21090d84eace038c0949484e899258d5be", "ja": "そうだよぉ。それに、\n別のところに泊まるなんて、さびしいべさ。", "zh": "对呀。而且要是住在别的地方，也会很寂寞的呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1025_036kan", "source_sha256": "9ef5e967a068b70788385a90e21fa5b4a388a3ccb049cd2666e4ed108cabfe95", "ja": "お世話になります！　寝るまで一緒だから、\nたくさんおしゃべりできるね♪", "zh": "承蒙照顾！在睡觉前我们都会待在一起，所以可以聊好多话了呢♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1026_051tmg", "source_sha256": "88b998ee3b42c96e70d9205b7fb5d7edfdd7a58ba43650015273d834f9cfb4c8", "ja": "ええ。では、まずは荷物を……\n？　あそこにいる小さな男の子は……？", "zh": "嗯。那么，先把行李……\n？　在那边的小男孩是……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1028_035hin", "source_sha256": "7de327b17efc13c11f408cb4ae8937a0ec57fd79f453f70b208847f59ed343d5", "ja": "ああ、あれはあたしの弟だべさ。\n彼方（かなた）ー、こっちきて挨拶だよぉ。", "zh": "啊，那个是我弟弟。\n彼方——，到这边来打招呼啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1029_kanata", "source_sha256": "ffb4567fe399f042f0daf38c145a6bd469d048bdfed78cc7137315d5f6a248db", "ja": "（ぼそぼそ）", "zh": "（小声嘟囔）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1030_036kan", "source_sha256": "d62677f0a1eb4c7c909957e4c3af8e2cad04b492589c418293128ce89b940511", "ja": "ん……？　ごめんね、よく聞こえなかったかも。\nもう一回、お願いできるかな？", "zh": "嗯……？抱歉，我好像没太听清。\n能请你再说一次吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1031_kanata", "source_sha256": "19614489e43d3fe8fd0a3d75f3ed7f4e4a802ebe8fd7b2d919085a9794693ba7", "ja": "……木下、彼方です。", "zh": "……我是木下彼方。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1032_035hin", "source_sha256": "7ef22f62fceb0737c6671a3010a22439764d3d0421add998e09dc90aa68d8071", "ja": "ありゃ、照れてるんかい？\n挨拶は大きな声でないとねぇ。", "zh": "哎呀，害羞了吗？\n打招呼声音可得响亮些才行呀。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1033_051tmg", "source_sha256": "ea834e706afa2e7bc9ca68a5ef5396d5f0b505eb5b25c6bda4de3f25049aa96b", "ja": "知らない人ばかりですから、緊張しますよね。\n仕方ありません。", "zh": "周围都是不认识的人，紧张也是难免的。\n没关系的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1034_035hin", "source_sha256": "5061af8220d7cd216c952add187bc80311e6211d35ee6db8cfcbcaa4cc518e28", "ja": "恥ずかしがり屋で、困ったもんだよぉ。\n彼方、りんご磨きは終わったのかい？", "zh": "这孩子太害羞了，真拿她没办法呀。\n彼方，苹果擦完了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1035_kanata", "source_sha256": "02ba61ebfbefac2e7fa7e06e7cef3127a6008bf5f3e21d03135e22bd140d224f", "ja": "もうすこし。\n夕飯前には終わるよ。", "zh": "再坚持一下。\n晚饭前就能结束了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1036_p", "source_sha256": "3616ae4a8cc4a92d5d4d1d048073a65d3061955300725bf2c9f5618b670be76c", "ja": "りんご磨き？", "zh": "擦苹果？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1037_035hin", "source_sha256": "dc69dcee16bdf129e37279dc27ee254edfa6222756da2c443911269dee2c8311", "ja": "早いのは、もう収穫の時期だからねぇ。\nりんごを磨いて、詰め込んで、出荷するべさ。", "zh": "之所以这么早，是因为已经到收获的时节了呀。\n把苹果擦亮、装箱，然后发货。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1038_baatyan", "source_sha256": "81a055f4aa6fcdf0a1736d0700887e97860464646ed786e56e8b5e8d8d900a2b", "ja": "劇場のみなさんへ贈るりんごも、\nこの彼方が磨くのを手伝ってくれてるんだよぉ。", "zh": "送给剧场大家的苹果，也是彼方帮忙擦亮的哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1039_p", "source_sha256": "065adc4e568e7893125943eb4f2caf6254a93201ddb12968e8e993cb559a24b4", "ja": "あのピカピカのりんごは、君が磨いてくれていたのか。\nいつも美味しくいただいてるよ、ありがとう。", "zh": "原来那颗闪闪发亮的苹果是你帮忙擦的啊。\n我一直都吃得很香，谢谢你。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1040_kanata", "source_sha256": "dfba44a6bc2c696b60847efcc66ea45c710d61baf32f365d2929c66b56312731", "ja": "（こくり）", "zh": "（点头）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1041_036kan", "source_sha256": "97745fc21e50e2694090f095f1d1c13d95b102d5b7702c93ca0ea9d04c484b5c", "ja": "あの……私も、りんご磨きやってみたいです！\nお手伝いしても、いいですか？", "zh": "那个……我也想试着擦苹果！\n可以让我帮忙吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1042_035hin", "source_sha256": "5762bdcb9f8ec504c17af191b6b169681201b2b8b478d31de86055139e2331ba", "ja": "え？\nでも、お客さんにそんなこと……。", "zh": "诶？\n可是，怎么能让客人做这种事……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1043_051tmg", "source_sha256": "80dab45c6793fe2863ea9646a8d996bc5b2603ddacdcc44f734d71d2885f7e8c", "ja": "木下さん。今日は手の内を探りにきたと言った\nはずです。ここまできて、秘密はなしですよ。", "zh": "木下小姐，我应该说过，今天就是来探探你的底细的吧。都到这一步了，可不能藏着秘密哦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1044_035hin", "source_sha256": "78989bd5575d66b8428ddd4c2e4a2c8c04ca5f1b8333ded930dfa14fcf36a4e8", "ja": "あっ……そうだったねぇ。\n彼方、みんなに教えてあげられるかい？", "zh": "啊……对哦。\n彼方，你能告诉大家吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1045_kanata", "source_sha256": "21d19cc205f8c92ca21ca07cde877279bf8bd1d17702df7578de4407e558a7e1", "ja": "うん……こっち……。", "zh": "嗯……这边……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1046_036kan", "source_sha256": "6276c4a6b06f601e7fd0f2c7f44c0868a43ad056262d7b6665128f6d0ec08eec", "ja": "あっ、彼方くん！　待って～！", "zh": "啊，彼方君！等等我～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1047_051tmg", "source_sha256": "aba369d6a863397ad8ea9ad59fbd09a9721f993f92d71340e686b0fc4cf8ae05", "ja": "わ、私もまいります。", "zh": "我、我也去。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1048_035hin", "source_sha256": "eac432a66e9c7aa67b5a1b571ca1bd2631cd897c61307cd8ededbbb8d0b98e0b", "ja": "う～ん、大丈夫だろか……。\nばあちゃん、あとで見てあげてくれるかい？", "zh": "嗯～没问题吧……  \n奶奶，待会儿能帮我看看吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1049_baatyan", "source_sha256": "07d708b1498907ab7735ff669fa0dace7dbd3581055b47831fa48b477c92c520", "ja": "そのつもりだよ。\n彼方は、引っ込み思案な子だからねぇ。", "zh": "就是这个打算哦。\n彼方是个比较内向的孩子嘛。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"base_version": "9.0.200+1077500", "bundle": "event_0402_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0402_story_04_1050_p", "source_sha256": "5503be3a570ce37b775353ac299d0b09ce5be057fec26ca75e01db232e561fe8", "ja": "（ひなたが、しっかりとお姉さんをしている……。\n早速、地元ならではの顔を覗けた気がするな）", "zh": "（日向确实很有姐姐的样子……看来马上就能看到她独具家乡特色的一面了。）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
